// Spy: Revolver, Knife (instant kill from behind), Sapper (disables and
// destroys enemy buildings), Disguise Kit (primary disguises as the next
// class, reload drops the disguise). Secondary fire with any Spy weapon
// cloaks; that is handled by tfPlayer.

